OL,3,GNEWSAAnger as village play park set on
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters were called to deal with a
OL,7,F"dangerous" and "reckless" fire at a
OL,8,Fvillage playground, a parish council
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FMeasham Parish Council said the New
OL,12,FStreet play park was targeted at about
OL,13,F13:30 GMT on Friday afternoon with
OL,14,F"children seen running away".
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the council called
OL,17,Fthe fire "completely unacceptable" and
OL,18,Fsaid future investment in parks would
OL,19,Fbe at risk if there was any further
OL,20,Fvandalism.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
